Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything went pretty smoothly after\Nwe defeated the Labyrinth Stratum Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.76,0:00:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and two days later, we finally\Nmade it out of the maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.12,0:00:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come everything\Naround here is so empty?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cause outside the occasional hunter,\Npeople rarely come to this stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The facilities are specifically for\Nhunters, so they're rather barebones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.28,0:00:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't see any walls put up,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so how do they protect\Nthemselves from monster attacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Outside of the maze,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the rest of the stratum is a wasteland\Nwhere not even monsters can survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.88,0:00:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are many aspects of the\Ndungeon that are still unknown to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.24,0:00:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,despite years of research,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.98,0:00:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,most pressing of which is the recent\Nresurgence of stratum lords we've been seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help but think it's\Nan ill omen of things to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess encountering two\Nstratum lords back to back would
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:01:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be nearly impossible under normal\Ncircumstances. We finally made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.12,0:01:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,made it the Labyrinth
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.54,0:01:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stratum's Hunters
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.45,0:01:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Association
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.37,0:01:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Bami. I didn't expect\Nto see you back so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.14,0:01:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.46,0:01:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're bored,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.64,0:01:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but surely there has to be something\Naround here that needs organizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.84,0:01:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, sorry about that, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.26,0:01:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, so Director Bear's\Nreal name is Balmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.86,0:01:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprisingly cute, but\Nthat doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's always gonna be Director Bear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.70,0:01:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've all been through quite a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.60,0:01:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get some rest, we'll talk more tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.86,0:01:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After finally reuniting with everyone\Nand finding a safe place to rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fell asleep for the first time since\Nfalling into the labyrinth stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.06,0:02:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The song of the day is an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so happy that I'm not frozen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.67,0:02:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so happy about this song?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.22,0:02:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you want me to play,\NI love you. I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.17,0:02:38.51,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine, {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.06,0:02:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you. It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many times do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.02,0:03:41.99,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(98,55)\fad(734,394)\fscx92}A Less-than-Ideal Hero
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.42,0:03:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then, we'll leave\Nthe rest to you. See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're staying here for\Na little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because Director Bear asked us to survey\Nthe perimeter of the giant labyrinth!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.38,0:04:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, my name is Mishuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.14,0:04:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out, Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy who just walked in is\Nsuper handsome, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.80,0:04:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, no kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.60,0:04:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.52,0:04:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind coming back in three days?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.84,0:04:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in the middle of updating our\Nmaps with the most current information.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.30,0:04:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll return another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.58,0:04:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.74,0:04:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.82,0:04:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is! Behold the hottie\Neffect! He looked exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how i imagine a gallant\Nhero out of a fairy tale
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.22,0:04:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would if you ask me that\Nstereotype has been blown
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.98,0:04:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way out of proportion i\Nmean just think of all the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,famous hunters you've heard\Nabout most of them are
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.10,0:04:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,either grizzled middle-aged\Ndudes or covered in muscles
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.62,0:05:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you know oh no you're right\Nbut not all of them what
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.06,0:05:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about the hunter called\Nshe of a hundred blessings
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.26,0:05:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and divine favor you\Nremember her right according
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to all of the stories i've\Nheard about her she was
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.72,0:05:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,super duper beautiful i\Nwant to be a hunter like her
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one day yeah i suppose\Nthere are exceptions to the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rule by all accounts her\Nbeauty was unmatched and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.02,0:05:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she was not only strong but\Nkind to everyone a perfect
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.40,0:05:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,person who knows maybe\Nthat pretty boy is destined
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.82,0:05:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to have his name carved\Ninto the history books too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's strong enough to challenge the\Nstratum by himself, he must be quite good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.52,0:05:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard there weren't\Nmany people around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.20,0:05:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the only reason I\Ncame. Oh man. What's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:06:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got this totally different\Nkind of depressed vibe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hottie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More like definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.06,0:06:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so nervous I wanted to throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get why everybody\Nstares at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.02,0:06:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me this is the real him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.58,0:06:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take this kind\Nof pressure anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I keep talking to people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish everybody would\Njust leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's actually really\Nbad at communicating,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.90,0:06:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and to hide it, he's completely\Nassumed this hot guy persona?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.86,0:06:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's suddenly a lot more\Nrelatable. Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.50,0:06:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom would always scold me whenever I'd\Nstart to wallow in these negative thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.66,0:06:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta be positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.82,0:06:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I kind of want to help this guy out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.10,0:06:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember reading somewhere\Nthat chocolate has compounds
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in it that help people relax\Nand feel less stressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.74,0:06:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.09,0:06:55.56,sign_9881_78_Gentle_Cocoa,text,0,0,0,,Gentle Cocoa
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.96,0:07:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.87,0:07:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so sweet and delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.62,0:07:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a lot more calm now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.52,0:07:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a fantastic magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, I'm not dealing with a person, so\Nbuying things here isn't nerve-wracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.15,0:07:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow I'll negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.22,0:07:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he going to try to buy me from Llamas?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.34,0:07:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mishuel said he wanted to accompany us\Non our assignment from Director Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.84,0:07:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's what he meant\Nwhen he said negotiation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.54,0:07:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot for tagging along,\Nbut what about your own quest?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.22,0:07:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you have time to finish it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm cool with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.10,0:07:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got yet another capable\Nhunter in our party now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seems reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I for one am super happy\Nyou wanted to come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not every day we get a chance\Nto travel with the aloof Black Flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.50,0:07:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha, but of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.88,0:08:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mishuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta change up your\Nresponses a little, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.06,0:08:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sound like an NPC.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hulemy, how long is it going to take us to\Nmake it all the way around the labyrinth?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.32,0:08:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based off the pictures, Boxxo, I'd say\Nit'll take us no more than three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Mishuel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.16,0:08:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha, but of course. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.36,0:08:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be in the rear to make sure\Nwe don't get attacked from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.96,0:08:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine! Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.14,0:08:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There go the communication issues again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've been paying close attention\Nto him while we've been walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.96,0:08:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My personal goal for this month,\Nlearn to act natural around strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.26,0:08:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is be nice and relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.58,0:08:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That shouldn't be too difficult, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's the reason\Nhe decided to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying his best to improve\Nhis crippling social anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was really nervous,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,traveling with two beauties, and the band\Nof gluttons are all so cute I want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.40,0:09:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing I could do was keep\Na straight face and not stare.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.98,0:09:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone insisted that we go to sleep\Nand let Boxxo take care of keeping watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.42,0:09:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe this magic item\Nhas a mind of its own. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.96,0:09:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, good evening to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.90,0:09:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.42,0:09:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it's funny, shopping\Nusually stresses me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.46,0:09:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yup. One of the vending machine's\Nmany advantages is its accessibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.60,0:09:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so a week went by\Nwithout the barest hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.80,0:09:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of fighting and the days\Nwere quiet and peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.32,0:10:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But today there seemed to be\Nsomething that was bothering Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.42,0:10:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.60,0:10:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you not get enough sleep last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.30,0:10:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're feeling under the weather,\Nyou and Boxo can come right on the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm doing just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.88,0:10:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't be feeling any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.26,0:10:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.74,0:10:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't overexert yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.26,0:10:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should take breaks when you need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.34,0:10:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice one, Mishuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.60,0:10:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.51,0:10:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you look after her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.18,0:10:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.00,0:10:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, first let's get\Nyou out of those clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.36,0:10:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.28,0:10:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me just a second\Nand I'll do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try to play the hero when\Nyou're on the verge of collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.88,0:10:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to learn to accept\Nkindness when it's offered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.72,0:10:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As usual, you stubbornly try to\Npush yourself past your limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:10:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.91,0:10:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was she sick or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.44,0:11:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At times like this, you've got\Nto rest, not power through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.76,0:11:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.12,0:11:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Llamas sometimes has off days\Nlike this, about once every month.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.40,0:11:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have picked up on it faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.12,0:11:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.24,0:11:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be that she's hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.18,0:11:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suco, do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.50,0:11:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard about this\Nhappening with humans
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.46,0:11:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a bunch of other monkey-like species.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their women have this thing where they'll
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.50,0:11:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,occasionally bleed from\Ntheir private parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.94,0:11:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish there was something\NI could do to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.14,0:11:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.24,0:11:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, what's up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.56,0:11:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you've transformed, then that must mean\Nyou came up with some kind of plan, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh how are we supposed to use this the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cloth has a strange feel to it or is it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.14,0:11:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,paper wait Maybe it's absorbing it all so
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.76,0:12:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,quickly i see this will come in handy it's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.10,0:12:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not something i'd normally Think about you\Nsee a ton of female adventurers and all
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.16,0:12:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorts of fantasy media but in real life\NYou've got to deal with this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.55,0:12:24.55,sign_14158_138_Insert_Payment,text (left),0,0,0,,{\c&HDAC2ED&\3c&H202E9E&\pos(82,55)\fs18\fsp.2}Insert coins
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.55,0:12:24.55,sign_14158_138_Insert_Payment,text (middle),0,0,0,,{\c&HDAC2ED&\3c&H202E9E&\pos(310,50)\fs18\an2\fsp.5}Items inside\N are washed
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.55,0:12:24.55,sign_14158_138_Insert_Payment,text (right),0,0,0,,{\c&HDAC2ED&\3c&H202E9E&\pos(425,55)\fs18\fscx80}Your laundry is clean!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.44,0:12:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.08,0:12:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to take this for a spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.80,0:12:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the first load is on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.04,0:12:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been over two weeks since we\Nset out to survey the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.22,0:12:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to Hulami's estimations,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should be able to return to the\NLabyrinth Stratum Village in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.58,0:12:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the incident with Lamas, Mishwa\Nstarted hanging out with everyone more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's adjusting pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.28,0:12:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:13:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo is a truly\Noutstanding magic item, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.56,0:13:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.70,0:13:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His food and drinks are super tasty\Nand he has all sorts of useful tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.68,0:13:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On top of that, he even protects us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.46,0:13:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been studying magic\Nitems for a long time now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I've never heard of any artifact like\NBoxxo showing up in the dungeon before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.70,0:13:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Mikenne?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.14,0:13:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop the cart, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.56,0:13:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you smell something, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.58,0:13:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I smell it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a faint scent of humans\Ncoming from further up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four or five of them, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.20,0:13:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't make out what\Nthey're saying from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but from the base in their\Nvoices, it sounds like men I see,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.42,0:13:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There shouldn't be any\Nhunters in a place like this
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.04,0:13:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get a bad\Nfeeling about this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, everybody, but there's a good\Nchance these people have come here for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.94,0:13:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was never my intention to\Ndrag you into my problems,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.50,0:13:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so please let me face them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.34,0:14:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know if it's you they're after?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.14,0:14:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, even if they are, we\Ncan't just let you go by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.88,0:14:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.46,0:14:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you guys follow me, your\Nlives will be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.50,0:14:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.90,0:14:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we decide anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.36,0:14:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mind telling us who these people\Nare and why they're after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.68,0:14:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His communication issues were a little\Nrough, but they were manageable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.76,0:14:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This secretiveness, on the\Nother hand, is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.12,0:14:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I totally get that you're\Nconcerned about us getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But trust me, we'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.42,0:14:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Boxxo by our side, there's no\Nway things will go wrong. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.54,0:14:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be easier to show him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did this blue light come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called a barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.00,0:14:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Boxo's blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.22,0:14:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this barrier can\Nwithstand an attack from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.10,0:14:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would it put your mind at ease\Nabout letting us come along?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.06,0:14:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well but if I can breach his\Ndefenses will you promise that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.02,0:15:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you won't follow after me no matter\Nwhat we promise all right then I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't hold anything
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.67,0:15:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.59,0:15:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bring
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.28,0:15:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can throw whatever you want at
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the barrier I know it'll block it\Ncome on barrier I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.78,0:15:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't work?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.22,0:15:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Points reduced by 500.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.10,0:15:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.02,0:15:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Crocodile Stratum Lord's Body\NSlam took 1,000 points when it hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.88,0:15:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying this was\Nhalf as strong as that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.12,0:15:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, way to go, Boxxo! Hello\Nthere! See? Everyone's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.62,0:15:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's why you don't have\Nto worry about us getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.84,0:15:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.16,0:15:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.30,0:16:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be counting on you if things\Ngo south, Boxo. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.32,0:16:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis, the five humans\Nare just ahead. He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.00,0:16:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three of their number are\Nprobably highly skilled swordsmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.20,0:16:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for the remaining two,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they most likely employ\Nthe power of blessings
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.76,0:16:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or cast magic spells of the four elements.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can sense all that from this far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.26,0:16:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.92,0:16:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not much help here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.12,0:16:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be Mr. Mishel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.58,0:16:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an honor it will\Nbe to claim your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.60,0:16:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.90,0:16:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, who hired you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.14,0:16:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.05,0:16:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm certain you already\Nhave at least some idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.46,0:16:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.32,0:17:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, are the beast person and\Nthe girl carrying that box your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.72,0:17:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're both strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.62,0:17:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We happened to take the same job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.94,0:17:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you come after\Nme, but if you attack them,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.00,0:17:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you won't live to regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.02,0:17:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, he's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.36,0:17:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.60,0:17:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.78,0:17:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hereby swear we won't\Nlay a single finger on
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.24,0:17:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them as long as you\Nsurrender without resisting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.28,0:17:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you don't\Nhave any other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.62,0:17:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what is your decision, Mr. Mishuel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have another option!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.34,0:17:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I defeat all of you, you won't\Neven have a chance to hurt them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.70,0:17:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How commendable of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got a warrior's\Nheart that much is certain,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.74,0:17:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and so we will grant\Nyou a warrior's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, be careful. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.26,0:17:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's hoping my barrier can\Nblock magic attacks, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, time to go ham on these jerks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.49,0:18:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A blessing that controls water?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.98,0:18:16.74,sign_14158_138_Insert_Payment,text,0,0,0,,{\frz56.49\fax-0.27\pos(5,310)}Insert Payment
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.98,0:18:16.74,sign_14158_138_Insert_Payment,text,0,0,0,,{\frz56.49\fax-0.27\fsp.1\pos(77,205)}Choose Settings
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.98,0:18:18.24,sign_14158_138_Insert_Payment,text,0,0,0,,{\frz56.49\fax-0.27\fscx72\pos(140,110)}Activate Trigger
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.98,0:18:18.24,sign_14158_138_Insert_Payment,text,0,0,0,,{\frz56.49\fax-0.83\fscx46\pos(185,40)}Replace When Done
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.12,0:18:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not strong enough to\Ncause any real injuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's enough to block your view.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you choke on some car\Nwash soap while you're at it?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.74,0:18:18.24,sign_14158_138_Insert_Payment,text,0,0,0,,{\frz56.49\fax-0.27\fsp.1\pos(77,205)\clip(m 60 200 l 145 147 111 116)}Choose Settings
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.28,0:18:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got some of it in my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.22,0:18:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.13,0:18:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.05,0:18:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck hitting anything with your\Nmagic while you have soap in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.68,0:18:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for rinse mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.94,0:18:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.85,0:18:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurts so bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Mishuel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.56,0:18:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're done over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.32,0:19:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you weren't here, things\Ncould have gotten dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.72,0:19:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.63,0:19:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it wasn't a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.18,0:19:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you go fetch the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.08,0:19:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still have a fair bit of information\NI need to get out of these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.94,0:19:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be back with Hulemy\Nand the others right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.62,0:19:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like Mishuel's got\Na lot going on with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.66,0:19:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be best if we don't\Npry too much into his business.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.48,0:19:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.44,0:19:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for involving\Nyou in my personal matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.86,0:19:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.46,0:19:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo's pulled me into\Nplenty of trouble by getting
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kidnapped and then falling\Ninto a stratum split,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.76,0:19:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that right. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.30,0:19:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, and thanks for\Nalways coming to my rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.56,0:19:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't tell you any details,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.86,0:19:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but as you can see, my life is\Nbeing targeted by assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.64,0:19:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we continue to travel together,\Nyour lives will be put in danger again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.74,0:19:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'll be transferring\Nto another stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.90,0:19:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate everything\Nyou've done to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.02,0:20:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I have an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.56,0:20:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of traveling alone, why don't\Nyou join the Menagerie of Fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.08,0:20:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'd welcome you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.20,0:20:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain mentioned before he was\Nlooking for new talented hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.92,0:20:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I remember he was\Ngoing on and on about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost wanted to punch him in\Nthe mouth to make him shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.62,0:20:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said, as long as they're\Nstrong, who cares about their past?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.12,0:20:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty much everyone here\Nis in some kind of mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.96,0:20:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I've heard of them before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.70,0:20:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't they a really\Nfamous group of hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.96,0:20:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We take on jobs with them\Nevery once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all such kind\Nand interesting people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.78,0:20:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, just talk to them about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.40,0:20:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go overthinking it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.58,0:20:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.70,0:20:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll reach out to them\Nas soon as I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.38,0:20:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe one day we'll work together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.14,0:20:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know anyone in the menagerie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to talk to\Na bunch of strangers?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.68,0:20:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't handle something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.34,0:21:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a good day, but it's a special day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.68,0:21:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to be a happy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to be a happy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.82,0:21:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This moment is a happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.52,0:21:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today is one day. Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.76,0:22:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After finishing Director Bear's request,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.02,0:22:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we finally made our way back up\Nto the Clear Flow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.20,0:22:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.00,0:22:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn I\Nsaw Voxo doing business
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.20,0:22:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here in the village just over a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.48,0:22:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.96,0:22:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems I've got a couple\Nof impersonators now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.00,0:22:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're set up where\NChain's restaurant used
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.06,0:23:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be a silver coin was\Ninserted wait a sec what
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.16,0:23:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kind of magic item coughs\Nthank you very much
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.60,0:23:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This tastes exactly like the food\NChains Restaurant used to serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.90,0:23:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so we put two and two together. It was
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.32,0:23:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All a setup. Chains\NRestaurant placed those
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.94,0:23:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fake vending machines in order to try to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.64,0:23:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,steal customers the next\Nday I started selling
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.64,0:23:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my wares again and what do you know before
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.88,0:23:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the week was up all the\Nfake vending machines
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.86,0:23:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,went out of business thank you very much\NI look forward to serving you again Amen.
